section.section_3_1
    p.caption.no-letter.caption_3 The World That Made Stalin — and the World That Stalin Made
    ul
        li
            strong Author:
            |&#32;Ronald Suny
        li
            strong Published:
            |&#32;
            span(data-type="date") 9 October, 2020
        li
            a(href="https://jacobin.com/2020/09/stalin-early-years-georgia-soviet-union-ronald-suny" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener external") Source
    h1
        |Some aspects of
        |&#32;
        span(data-type="person" data-id="JoSt") Stalin’s
        |&#32;
        |life will always remain a mystery. But a fresh look at the Soviet dictator’s formative years can help us understand the rise and fall of the system he built.
